{
    "id":  10872,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Strip 24V RGB | 5m | COB | 672LED/m | 15W/M | IP20",
    "reference":  "SP672D-15W-RGB-91863",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover our\u003cstrong\u003e RGB COB LED Strip Light 15W!\u003c/strong\u003e It offers a full spectrum of vibrant colors, with 5W in red, 5W in green, and 5W in blue, allowing you to\u003cstrong\u003e create personalized\u003c/strong\u003e and lively environments. \u003cstrong\u003eWith \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e672 \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ediodes per meter\u003c/strong\u003e and an efficiency of\u003cstrong\u003e 140 Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e, this strip provides bright and energetic lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Possibility of cutting every 3,3 cm\u003c/strong\u003e. Its IP20 design makes it ideal for indoor applications, where you can enjoy intense colors and easy installation. Comes with a 3M adhesive tape for easy attachment to any surface.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Strip 24V RGB COB | 5m | 672LED/m | 15W/m | IP20 | Cut 3,3cm\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the magic of our\u003cstrong\u003e 15W COB RGB LED Strip\u003c/strong\u003e and transform your environment in style! With an efficiency of \u003cstrong\u003e140Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e672 \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ediodes per metre\u003c/strong\u003e, this strip provides bright and energetic lighting that will captivate your senses. With 5W in Red, 5W in Green and 5W in Blue, you can immerse yourself in a vibrant colour palette that will elevate the atmosphere of any space.  In addition, its design allows it to be cut every 3,3cm, giving you the flexibility to adapt it to your lighting and design needs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIdeal for indoor applications thanks to its IP20 design, you can enjoy vivid colours and easy installation in any environment. It also comes with a\u003cstrong\u003e 3M adhesive strip\u003c/strong\u003e for easy attachment to any surface, making it even more versatile and practical to use.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore new lighting possibilities and create unique, personalised environments with our 15W COB RGB LED RGB LED Strip - bring your space to life with vibrant colours and positive energy!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#0d0d0d;font-family:\u0027Söhne\u0027, \u0027ui-sans-serif\u0027, \u0027system-ui\u0027, \u0027-apple-system\u0027, \u0027Segoe UI\u0027, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \u0027Noto Sans\u0027, sans-serif, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, Arial, \u0027Apple Color Emoji\u0027, \u0027Segoe UI Emoji\u0027, \u0027Segoe UI Symbol\u0027, \u0027Noto Color Emoji\u0027;font-size:16px;\"\u003eHighlighted benefits of the 24V RGB COB LED Strip 5M\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited customisation:\u003c/strong\u003e The RGB COB RGB LED Strip allows for total customisation thanks to its ability to cut every 3,3cm. Adapt it to the exact length you need for your lighting projects, from decorative details to more extensive applications.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful brightness and energy efficiency:\u003c/strong\u003e With a total power of 15W and 24V power supply, this strip offers a powerful and crisp brightness, ensuring intense illumination wherever you need it. Plus, its energy efficiency allows you to enjoy spectacular lighting without worrying about excessive power consumption.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTough, durable design:\u003c/strong\u003e The IP20 rating of the strip ensures its suitability for indoor use, protecting the LEDs and ensuring long-lasting performance. Its rugged design gives you the confidence of a reliable and long-lasting lighting solution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Thanks to its practical design, the RGB COB RGB LED Strip is easily installed on any flat surface. Whether it\u0027s to highlight specific areas in your home, create a festive atmosphere or enhance the lighting in your workspace, installation will be quick and hassle-free.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile uses:\u003c/strong\u003e From enhancing the décor at special events to creatively illuminating your living room, this LED strip adapts to a variety of uses. Its versatility gives you the freedom to explore and experiment with lighting in different contexts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#0d0d0d;font-family:\u0027Söhne\u0027, \u0027ui-sans-serif\u0027, \u0027system-ui\u0027, \u0027-apple-system\u0027, \u0027Segoe UI\u0027, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \u0027Noto Sans\u0027, sans-serif, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, Arial, \u0027Apple Color Emoji\u0027, \u0027Segoe UI Emoji\u0027, \u0027Segoe UI Symbol\u0027, \u0027Noto Color Emoji\u0027;font-size:16px;\"\u003eHighlighted uses and applications of the 24V RGB COB LED Strip 5M\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAmbient Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Create a welcoming and personalised ambience in your home, highlighting specific areas with the perfect blend of colours.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eParties and Events:\u003c/strong\u003e Add a festive touch to your celebrations with dynamic, eye-catching lighting effects that are sure to leave a lasting impression.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInterior Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Bring your interior design projects to life by highlighting architectural features or accentuating decorative elements with light.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSignage and Display:\u003c/strong\u003e Use the strip to create illuminated signs, eye-catching displays or to highlight products in shop windows.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLight Art Creation:\u003c/strong\u003e Express your creativity by using the strip to create light art, visual installations or custom decorative effects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake every corner a scene of unforgettable colours and experiences with our 15W RGB COB LED Strip! Transform your space and add a modern and vibrant touch - don\u0027t wait any longer to light up your life in style!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e* Power Supply NOT included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
